listing:   capture of the run above (dns.pcapng)
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r dns.pcapng; tshark -r dns.pcapng -O dns -V -Y frame.number==2; tshark -r dns.pcapng -x -Y frame.number==1
date:      2026-10-09T22:13:34Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
network:   private network and mount namespaces (unshare -n -m); /etc/resolv.conf there: nameserver 127.0.0.1
exit code: 0
